[36m(TaskRunner pid=180524)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=180524)[0m We need the divisors of \(362880\) that have a units digit of 1. These divisors must be coprime to 10, meaning they must not be divisible by 2 or 5. Therefore, such divisors must be of the form \(3^b \times 7^d\) where \(0 \leq b \leq 4\) and \(0 \leq d \leq 1\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=180524)[0m 
